  "requirements": [
    "Direct assignment of current installed Hero remaining health, distinct from setting maximum health",
    "Preserve current maximum, armor and applicable attachments; direct assignment does not impersonate Damage/Heal/LoseHealth",
    "Reuse original remaining-health ledger, death checkpoints, transactions, persistence, replay and information",
    "Explicitly establish or retain unknown policy for requested health above current maximum, zero/lethal and event windows"
  ],
