  "policy": "SetHeroHealth targets an existing physical live installed Hero and assigns remaining health to min(requested,current maximum). Keep maximum/armor/enchantments; no damage/healing/loss pipeline. Publish a health-set event carrying the original actual Hero transition. Existing death checkpoints handle zero; stale/replaced/doomed/dead targets do not revive. Requests above maximum clamp as explicit uncalibrated local policy.",
